{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56229","headline":"题十八贤影堂诗 · 贯休","name":"题十八贤影堂诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白藕池边旧影堂，刘雷风骨尽龙章。\n共轻天子诸侯贵，惟爱君师一法长。\n陶令醉多招不得，谢公心乱入无方。\n何人到此思高躅，风点苔痕过短墙。\n（《大正藏》第四七册元普度《庐山莲宗宝监》卷四。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}